<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for three N.Y. bond issuers.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for three N.Y. bond issuers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Tuesday it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for the following three issuers:</p>
<p>--New York State Dormitory Authority, for the New York City court system.</p>
<p>--New York City general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--New York State Dormitory Authority or MCFFA mental health bonds.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-MBIA-NOW. Capacity is limited to $10 million per firm.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
